```hcl
terraform {
  required_version = ">= 1.14"

  required_providers {
    xcsh = {
      source  = "f5-sales-demo/xcsh"
      version = "= 12.4.0"
    }
  }
}

provider "xcsh" {}

resource "xcsh_rate_limiter" "synthetic_rate" {
  name      = "synthetic-rate"
  namespace = "synthetic-lab"
}
```

Based on the standalone [Resource example](xcsh://terraform-documentation/documentation/resources/rate_limiter/examples/resource/index.md?view=context#resource), with the bundled provider pinned to **v12.4.0** and Terraform’s minimum updated to the maintained [requirements](xcsh://terraform-documentation/documentation/provider/setup/index.md?view=context#requirements).

### Supplied field constraints

| Field | Provider schema | Documented upstream constraints |
|---|---|---|
| [`name`](xcsh://terraform-documentation/documentation/resources/rate_limiter/properties/index.md?view=context#schema-name) | Required string; `NameValidator()` | Unique within namespace; cannot change through replace API. DNS-1035 label, 1–63 characters. |
| [`namespace`](xcsh://terraform-documentation/documentation/resources/rate_limiter/properties/index.md?view=context#schema-namespace) | Required string; `NamespaceValidator()` | DNS label, 1–63 characters. |

Both values satisfy the documented upstream pattern `^[a-z]([-a-z0-9]*[a-z0-9])?$`. These numeric and pattern constraints come from receipt-pinned upstream metadata, not observed local validation.

Only `name` and `namespace` are [required root properties](xcsh://terraform-documentation/documentation/resources/rate_limiter/index.md?view=context#root-configuration); no limits or additional scalar values were invented.

[Prerequisites](xcsh://terraform-documentation/documentation/resources/rate_limiter/index.md?view=context#prerequisites): Standard service tier and access to the target namespace. Configure `XCSH_API_URL` and exactly one authentication method through environment variables.

**Validation:** Documentation-checked draft only; Terraform execution and live deployment were not performed.
